                +----------------------------+
  intento k --> | Actor (LLM, tipo ReAct)    | <------+
                +----------------------------+        |
                              |                       |
                              v trayectoria           |
                +----------------------------+        |
                | Evaluator: ¿pasó?          |        |
                | (tests, heurística o LLM)  |        |
                +----------------------------+        |
                   |                     |            |
                sí v                  no v            |
            Respuesta      +-----------------------+  |
                           | Self-Reflection (LLM) |  |
                           | escribe la crítica    |  |
                           +-----------------------+  |
                                       |              |
                                       v              |
                           +-----------------------+  |
                           | memoria: 1 a 3        |--+
                           | reflexiones previas   | intento k+1
                           +-----------------------+

